{
  "adapter": "prism4.reference-json",
  "artifacts": [
    {
      "body": "Prism 4.0 is a lightweight governance protocol for humans and AI to maintain clear collaboration state in complex work. Core stays thin: Topic, Artifact, Capability, Invocation, Decision Semantics.",
      "id": "artifact:intent.foundation",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "evolution": "supersedable"
      },
      "role": "intent",
      "title": "Foundation Intent",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "Current slice: validate the Phase 2 JSON reference adapter and keep CLI cutover deferred. Review, Clarify, Record Decision, and Plan have minimal protocol evidence.",
      "id": "artifact:brief.current",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "projected",
        "evolution": "regenerable"
      },
      "role": "brief",
      "title": "Current Brief",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "The local representation should persist Topic, Artifact, SemanticPayload, Invocation, and Relation without making storage layout part of Core.",
      "id": "artifact:findings.phase-2",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "Phase 2 Findings",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation.phase-2"
    },
    {
      "body": "Accepted: use JsonReferenceStoreAdapter as the Phase 2 dogfood representation. The single-file JSON format is adapter evidence, not the Prism Core storage contract.",
      "id": "artifact:decision.phase-2-json-adapter",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "decision",
      "title": "Use JSON Reference Adapter",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "1. Keep the JSON adapter minimal. 2. Use this dogfood state as the first persisted 4.0 Topic. 3. Defer canonical CLI cutover until the protocol remains stable under this state.",
      "id": "artifact:plan.next",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "operative-after-authorization",
        "evolution": "historical-supersedable"
      },
      "role": "plan",
      "title": "Next Plan",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "1. CLI 与技能文档曾漂移：topic new 签名不一致、decision verb 被 legacy 路由拦截、plan / decision record 语义已定义但未接线。现已对齐并新增测试覆盖。2. resolve_root() 的 workspace 发现路径 workspace.*.local/topics/*/ 仍是 3.x 目录布局残留；4.0 JSON adapter 只需要 state 文件所在目录，桥接布局尚未被 4.0 语义重新定义。3. dogfood 状态与 SDK 仓库耦合：当前作为测试夹具随分支演进合理，但 Prism 项目自身的活跃协作状态在 4.0 稳定后应评估迁移到 Workspace backend。",
      "id": "artifact:findings.cli-cutover-round",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "advisory",
        "evolution": "historical"
      },
      "role": "findings",
      "title": "CLI Cutover Round Findings",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "Dogfood 状态在 4.0 稳定前保持 SDK 仓库内证据角色（测试夹具随分支演进）；4.0 稳定后评估迁移到 Workspace backend 或 workspace.prism.local 桥接。",
      "id": "artifact:decision.state-placement",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "authority_required": "human-required",
        "evolution": "committed"
      },
      "role": "decision",
      "title": "Dogfood State Placement",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    },
    {
      "body": "技能说明使用中文；协议原语术语（Topic / Artifact / Capability / Invocation / Decision / Intent / Brief / Findings / Plan / Review / Clarify）保留英文，与 grounding 文档 SSOT 一致。",
      "id": "artifact:decision.skill-language",
      "metadata": {
        "authority": "authoritative",
        "authority_required": "human-required",
        "evolution": "committed"
      },
      "role": "decision",
      "title": "Skill Language Policy",
      "topic_id": "topic:prism-4-refoundation"
    }
  ],
